  "acceptance": [
    "Encode v2 TransactionVersion INT8 after CoordinatorEpoch before marker tagged fields; response layout remains v1 flexible. Existing Admin force-abort negotiates highest <=2 and sends default0 exactly as official AbortTransactionHandler.",
    "New typed marker/codec retains INT8 values explicitly; v1/v0 omit the ignorable field; legacy request decoder remains explicit0/1 while versioned decoder exposes v2. Do not claim producer TXV2 recovery/replication because this wire field is present.",
    "Public Admin tests cover broker ranges1-only,2-only,1..2,unsupported; actual Metadata partition leader routing, NOT_LEADER retry/invalidation, fencing/error return, malformed/truncated v2, canceled/deadline work and unrelated operation continuity.",
    "Public abort response authority exactly matches official AbortTransactionHandler: exactly one requested producer, exactly one requested topic and exactly one requested partition are required before reading the error. Empty/omitted, duplicate or unrelated result identities are protocol failures, even when all included error codes are zero. Generic batched codecs remain capable of plural marker responses.",
    "Capture the inherited false-success counterexample and independent official handler failures before correcting it. Actual public socket cases cover missing marker/topic/partition, mismatched producer/topic/partition, duplicate target entries at each level, matching success/error and unrelated zero/nonzero entries; preserve retries only for the matching authoritative target error.",
    "Matching authoritative error8 BROKER_NOT_AVAILABLE and9 REPLICA_NOT_AVAILABLE refresh partition-leader Metadata and retry like official AbortTransactionHandler, scoped to this public operation. Controlled public socket tests cover8/9 then success, terminal cluster-authorization/producer-epoch/coordinator-fencing errors, retries exhausting one absolute deadline and cancellation. Do not alter global Error.is_retriable or unrelated transport behavior.",
    "Independent tests use full request/response frames and actual official serializer/parser for default0,TV1,TV2 and signed INT8 boundaries, empty/duplicate markers/topics/partitions, errors/tags/CRC-free request framing. Java public abortTransaction call must be observed as a genuine SDK wire operation separately from direct handler/codec fixtures.",
    "Keep existing public struct-literal types and legacy wire helpers source/byte compatible; additive typed APIs expose the new field without silently discarding it at the wire boundary.",
    "Fail invalid/unsupported versions before unrelated metadata/coordinator/network work. Positive nested-count/minimum-byte and frame/resource checks precede allocation; full successful body/header consumption and exact correlation/version are asserted.",
    "Preserve the existing operation routing/retry implementation once; both legacy projection and new typed operation share the same coordinator/leader invalidation and absolute deadline.",
    "Pin actual Apache4.1.2/4.2.1/4.3.1 jars, schemas and source. Execute independent fixtures in applicable versions and retain actual unsupported outcomes on4.1.2; do not claim fabricated full broker transaction/share semantics.",
    "Freeze and push exact source before immutable stable+1.85 default/all-feature behavioral/strict fmt/Clippy/rustdoc/doctest qualification; preserve first failures and all initial preparation attempts."
  ]
}
